    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “看它是不是在回答前一句、解释前一句，或继续一个时间",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1654
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "链。”",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1655
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这些关系尤其常见于说明文和建议类七选五。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1656
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1657
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 出现 first/then/later/finally → 检查顺序缺哪一步。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1658
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 前一句是问句 → 候选优先找直接回答。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1659
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 后一句有 example/for instance → 空位应提供可被举例的概括。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1660
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 步骤文检查动作是否有前置条件。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1661
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1662
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1663
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1664
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· question → answer",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1665
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· general statement → example",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1666
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· step 1 → step 2 → result",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1667
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 句子在时间/问答/例证链中的位置唯一合理。",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1668
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 若所有选项语义都通，画简单流程箭头，看哪个动作必须先发生。",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1669
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 60,
