    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 问句找回答，步骤看前后，例子先要概括。",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1682
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1684
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. First... then... finally 属于？",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1685
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 空后“For example”说明空前可能？",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1686
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 前句是Why...? 空后最可能？",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1687
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. “One reason...”通常前面需要？",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1688
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 举例句能放在没有总述的段首吗？",
      "sourcePage": 60,
      "sourceIndex": 1689
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 时间/顺序；2. 一个总观点。；3. 回答/解释。；4. 问题/观点/原因主题。；5. 通常不自然，需看上下",
      "sourcePage": 61,
      "sourceIndex": 1690
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "文。",
